    "body": "The spec source:\r\n```html\r\n  <h4><dfn>Serializable objects</dfn></h4>\r\n```\r\n\r\nis getting translated to\r\n```html\r\n  <h4 id=serializable-objects>\r\n    <span class=secno>2.7.1</span>\r\n    <dfn>Serializable objects</dfn>\r\n    <a href=#serializable-objects class=self-link></a>\r\n  </h4>\r\n```",
